    <string name="how_to_play_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_subtitle">Quick rules</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_steps">1. Gather your friends and open SospechApp.\n\n2. Set up the game (players and impostors) and, if you want, write a word. If you leave it empty, a random one will be used.\n\n3. Pass the phone so each player sees their role: citizens will see the word, the impostor will not.\n\n4. By talking, each player describes the word without saying it directly, while the impostor tries to blend in.\n\n5. At the end, vote who you think the impostor is. You can tweak the rules as much as you want to fit your group.\n\n6. Have fun and play several rounds!</string>
